f, a cliff tube, swimming reef raptors and diving stingrays.\n\u2022 New raptors everywhere, plus desert raptors in Sunscar Canyon. Two hits stun, the third drives them off.\n\u2022 Multiplayer: a results board and vote between courses, rejoin after a crash, and host handover.\n\u2022 Hand tracking: pinch to teleport, fist to hold the club, thumb down for the plunger.\n\u2022 Clubhouse: wardrobe, 13 achievements with name-tag titles, world-rank leaderboards and a music player.\n\u2022 Seated mode and height evening so every player can reach the ball.\n\u2022 Golden egg, woven nest, clearer distant beacons, and a stray line in the sky fixed.\n\u2022 Smaller download (about 1.3 GB), smoother first loads and relit worlds.", "created_date": 1791222546, "id": "28687937047538671", "version": "0.60", "version_code": 60, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "UNDER_REVIEW", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28687931024205940"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7242557155836637", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "8820460711379599"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1438346520109192"}]}, "change_log": "This is the latest version of crazy golf VR! Featuring Multiplayer, Avatars, and a fundamental redesign of the game. ", "created_date": 1790104131, "id": "28524623747203336", "version": "0.36", "version_code": 36, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28524616973870680"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": 